{"resourceIdentifier":"514","resourceName":"Promoting Sustainable Development through Natural Rubber Tree Plantations in Guatemala","description":"Validation achieved to the CCB Standards Second Edition, Biodiversity Gold Level, on 27 February 2014. Gap validation to remove two farms from the project area and verification achieved to the CCB Standards Second Edition, Biodiversity Gold Level on 03 March 2017.  The project will establish rubber tree plantations in a project boundary of 2,366.16 hectares of degraded and degrading lands where the traditional use has been cattle grazing, which corresponds to eligible area. The species planted will be Hevea brasiliensis. Direct planting of H. brasiliensis in the project area began in 2007 and will continue through 2013. The real or effective planted area corresponds to 2,252.23 hectares which is given by planting density of natural rubber plantations.  This area excludes other vegetated areas within project boundary such as creeks, borders’ vegetation, and small spots of vegetation.","location":{"latitude":14.458248,"longitude":-91.294307},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-05-15","endExclusive":"2024-06-15","endInclusive":"2024-06-14"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"514"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Izabal"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Negocios Energeticos de Occidente S.A."},{"type":"string","value":"Guatemala, Guatemala"},{"type":"string","value":"(502) 5303039"},{"type":"string","value":"iaguirre@econegocios.com.gt"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"514"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"514"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"46434"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUF